        <calculation class='tableau' formula='Case [Parameters].[매개 변수 1]&#10;When &apos;This Week&apos; Then DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= dateadd(&quot;week&quot;,-1,DateTrunc(&apos;week&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018])) and DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-7)&#10;&#10;When &apos;Last 7 days&apos; Then DATETRUNC(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= DATETRUNC(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-13 ) and DATETRUNC(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]-7 &#10;&#10;When &apos;Last 14 days&apos; Then DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-27) and DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]-14&#10;&#10;When &apos;Last 28 days&apos; Then DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-55) and DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]-28&#10;&#10;When &apos;Last 30 days&apos; Then DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-59) and DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]-30&#10;&#10;When &apos;Last 90 days&apos; Then DateTrunc(&apos;week&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-179) and DateTrunc(&apos;week&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]-90&#10;&#10;When &apos;This Year&apos; Then DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;,[Date])&gt;= DATEADD(&apos;year&apos;,-1,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]) and DateTrunc(&apos;month&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= DateTrunc(&apos;week&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-1)&#10;End' />
