os;,[Date]) &gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-29) and DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]&#10;When &apos;Pervious 30 days&apos; Then DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-59) and DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]-30&#10;&#10;When &apos;Last 90 days&apos; Then DateTrunc(&apos;week&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-89) and DateTrunc(&apos;week&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]&#10;When &apos;Pervious 90 days&apos; Then DateTrunc(&apos;week&apos;,[Date]) &gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;day&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]-179) and DateTrunc(&apos;week&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]-90&#10;&#10;When &apos;This Year&apos; Then DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;,[Date])&gt;= DateTrunc(&apos;year&apos;,[Calculation_2295287747341398018]) and DateTrunc(&apos;month&apos;,[Date]) &lt;= [Calculation_2295287747341398018]&#10;End' />
